recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the measurement stands and re-derives in 18 seconds, and %447 closed on metal. Two of the three buildables touch other seats' territory (Caravan, and the standing roster), so they are named rather than taken; the wake bound in Caravan is the one worth your word before anyone builds it.
